From e325a8fab09b7761a4b9e5123aa999ddb76e0975 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: baverrr <342259467+baverrr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 20:17:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Use the RavenOS glass theme for Quick Settings and
 screen record

Match Quick Settings and the screen record dialog to the RavenOS glass
theme used by Settings, with every color in res/values/raven_glass.xml
(same names and Midnight Aurora defaults as Settings) so a product
overlay can recolor them:

- Draw the QS panel and the tile detail view on the glass backdrop: navy
  with three soft glows, rounded to raven_card_radius, with a hairline
  edge. The strip behind the status bar and its fade use the backdrop
  navy instead of black.
- Theme qs_theme: active tiles are an accent circle with a dark icon,
  inactive tiles a faint glass circle with a light icon, and labels,
  footer icons, the brightness slider and ripples use the theme colors.
  qs_theme is also used by the volume dialog and the power menu, which
  pick up the same colors.
- Use the theme surface for the tile editor and the brightness mirror.
- Give the screen record dialog a dark surface card with a hairline
  edge, light text and icons, and accent switches and buttons, instead
  of the light dialog theme.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I7973f7b20da68f288841fbb8f62e169274595b92
